OrganicAudioMotion.qml, OrganicScreenEdge.qml, OrganicScreenEdge.frag,
OrganicIdleClock.qml and OrganicEdgeConfig.js are copied unchanged from iNiR
(https://github.com/snowarch/inir, modules/common/widgets and
modules/background/widgets), GPL-3.0. The baked OrganicScreenEdge.frag.qsb is
rebuilt locally:

  /usr/lib/qt6/bin/qsb --qt6 -o OrganicScreenEdge.frag.qsb OrganicScreenEdge.frag
